===========

Summary
StrOutputParser → Plain text.
JsonOutputParser → Structured JSON.
PydanticOutputParser → Validated Python objects.
RegexParser → Extract specific fields from text.
OutputFixingParser → Repair malformed output.
RetryOutputParser → Retry until valid output.
List parsers → Convert model output into Python lists.
XML/YAML parsers → Generate structured configuration formats.
Datetime/Enum parsers → Produce validated dates or constrained values.

These output parsers are commonly used with LangChain Expression Language (LCEL) (prompt | llm | output_parser) to build reliable AI applications.

